DESCRIPTION:Spend an evening with Duke alum Dr. Kemi Doll as she discusses
  her book\, A Terrible Strength\, which offers tools to unlearn the medic
 al normalization of Black Women's suffering\, along with a path forward f
 or healing.This event is open to all. Students\, staff\, and other member
 s of the community who have an interest in the topic are welcome to join!
  Book signing with Dr. Kemi Doll to follow.
