DESCRIPTION:The Duke Transplant Advanced Practice Provider Symposium ("APP
  Symposium") is an educational conference dedicated to healthcare profess
 ionals involved in solid organ transplantation\, with an emphasis on the 
 comprehensive care and long-term management of transplant recipients. The
  symposium provides updates on current clinical practices\, explores emer
 ging trends and innovations in transplantation\, and highlights projects 
 and initiatives led by transplant professionals from institutions nationw
 ide.\n\nOpen to all members of the transplant care team\, the APP Symposi
 um brings together transplant coordinators\, nurses\, nurse clinicians\, 
 transplant physicians\, transplant surgeons\, transplant pharmacists\, an
 d other healthcare professionals committed to improving the care of solid
  organ transplant patients. Nationally recognized\, the symposium welcome
 s participants from more than 40 transplant centers and organizations acr
 oss the country. Attendees benefit from expert-led presentations\, intera
 ctive case-based learning\, updates on the latest medications and researc
 h developments\, and evidence-based approaches that support outstanding p
 atient care and outcomes.
DURATION:P1D
DTSTAMP:20260707T191034Z
