DESCRIPTION:The Congregation's weekly Adult Forum offers a variety of gues
 t speakers\, presentations and discussions on a wide range of thought-pro
 voking topics\, including Biblical studies\, current social issues and th
 e work of mission agencies.  \n\nAdult Forum aims to deepen the faith and
  understanding of adults through shared learning experiences. Classes inc
 lude programs and discussions on contemporary issues in light of Christia
 n teachings.
