CREATED:20230805T023014Z
DESCRIPTION:Parker's research aims to develop statistical methods to tackl
 e the unique challenges presented by multi-institutional biomedical data 
 collection initiatives. In particular\, he is focused on understanding ho
 w to best analyze large-scale electronic health records data drawn from d
 iverse populations spread across heterogeneous healthcare systems. This w
 ork relies on methodological ideas from nonparametric and high-dimensiona
 l statistics\, optimization\, and time series modeling.
DURATION:PT1H
