DESCRIPTION:<b>For employees of Duke University and DUHS</b> \n<b>Continui
 ng Education Credits (CEUs):</b> 0.4\n\nIn every workplace\, you're likel
 y to encounter some challenging personalities. The first step in dealing 
 with a possible conflict situation is to determine if and how you might b
 e contributing to the situation. This course will identify four types of 
 conflict\, how to defuse emotionally charged situations\, and how to iden
 tify and deal with negative behaviors.
