CREATED:20260817T120600Z
DESCRIPTION:Most AI projects don't fail because the technology isn't ready
 \, they fail because the workflow around it was never designed with AI's 
 actual strengths and limitations in mind. This workshop teaches you how t
 o think before you build: how modern AI works at a conceptual level\, whe
 re it excels\, where it predictably breaks\, and how it differs from trad
 itional software. You'll learn a practical decision framework for determi
 ning whether AI\, traditional automation\, or a simple process improvemen
 t is the right answer for your use case.
DURATION:PT2H
