DESCRIPTION:Join local fiber artist Kimberley Pierce Cartwright for a hand
 s-on quilting workshop that celebrates creativity\, storytelling\, and co
 mmunity. Participants will learn the basics of hand sewing while creating
  an improvised mini quilt using fabric\, needle\, and thread. No prior se
 wing or quilting experience is necessary. All materials will be provided\
 , though we encourage participants to bring any small embellishments or s
 entimental fabric scraps.
