DESCRIPTION:For members of Duke's Creator Lab:\n\nAdobe Acrobat Express fo
 r Students is Duke's newest Adobe offering\, now available to all student
 s. Come get hands-on with the platform and explore how Adobe tools and AI
  can help you create\, communicate and build skills for what's next. \n\n
 In this 90-minute interactive session\, Todd Taylor\, Ph.D.\, pedagogical
  evangelist at Adobe\, will cover Adobe AI\, how it compares with other p
 latforms\, the ethics of generative AI\, building a skills portfolio\, an
 d the "habits of mind" that help you ask smarter questions about emerging
  technologies.\n\nThe workshop will be ideal for students who want to imp
 rove their digital content production skills\, especially for social medi
 a.\n\nBring a fully charged laptop and download Adobe Express\, Creative 
 Cloud or any Adobe apps you use before the session so you can jump right 
 in.\n\nSeating is limited. Registration details coming soon.
DURATION:PT1H30M
