 m Residency with April Berry from September 28 to October 2 at the Rubens
 tein Arts Center. Participants will have the opportunity to engage with A
 pril Berry\, an original cast member of Alvin Ailey American Dance Theate
 r's "The Magic of Katherine Dunham" and transmitter of Ms. Dunham's legac
 y in Dunham Technique Classes\, Film Screening\, and Community Conversati
 on.\n\nClasses accompanied by percussionists: Bashir Shakur\, Phillip Liv
 er Pool\, Richard Vinesett and Beverly Botsford.\n\nDuke students can sig
 n up for this class: https://duke.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_b1oEOdNeY3F6f
 CS\n\nFull residency information and schedule: https://danceprogram.duke.
 edu/katherine-dunham-residency-april-berry
