DESCRIPTION:For more than 50 years\, the Sit Lead II® Model has enabled le
 aders at all levels of the organization to more effectively influence oth
 ers. Developed by Ken Blanchard\, Situational Leadership is a leadership 
 model that every manager can master. The manager must make a commitment t
 o developing each and every direct report.\n\n<b>ASSESSMENT:</b> We will 
 use the LBAII (Leader Behavior Analysis II) assessment\; all participants
  must complete the assessment at least one week prior to the start of the
  course. The facilitator will send an email with instructions on how to a
 ccess the assessment at least two weeks prior to the class start date.
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260205T123000
